// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P3038304210" "There's a lot of chatter on the police band about {BOSS_NAME} of the {VillainGroup}. Perhaps you should step in before some of Paragon's finest get hurt?"
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P1767814601" "You've heard of {BOSS_NAME} of the {VillainGroup} before. You better put a stop to this before people get hurt."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P3170946205" "The {VillainGroup} has been brazenly defying the forces of law and order lately. From the sound of things on the police band, that's probably because of {BOSS_NAME}."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P431173293" "{BOSS_NAME} of the {VillainGroup} is on the loose, and people are scared. Time to make Paragon City a little bit safer."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P3171628426" "As the Police band dispatcher rattles off the crimes that put an APB on {BOSS_NAME}, you remember that you'd heard where that villain might be holed up."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P3563618376" "{BOSS_NAME} has been on the suspect lists of many heroes for some time. Bringing that rogue in could help a number of investigations."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P202440035" "{BOSS_NAME} has escaped the Zigg? No doubt with the help of cronies among the {VillainGroup}. The streets won't be safe until you've brought the escapee back to justice."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P815128266" "{BOSS_NAME} at large? This can't be good. It will only be a matter of time until {BOSS_NAME} has amassed a group of the {VillainGroup} and takes to the streets. Time to stop this, now."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P452770851" "Does {BOSS_NAME} think that justice can be escaped that easily? Some villains never learn, but that's why heroes like you must confront them."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P3676318888" "You'd heard that {BOSS_NAME} was one of the upcoming new names among the {VillainGroup}. Time to show everyone there that crime doesn't pay."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P2948975441" "You've heard that {BOSS_NAME} was bad news. Taking care of this situation before innocent people get hurt would be a good idea."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P2221362081" "The police band calls it a threat, but you know that this is a challenge. Well, if {BOSS_NAME} wants a fight, then you'll be ready to give one."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P843995044" "You'd heard that {BOSS_NAME} didn't have any moral scruples, but selling secrets to Arachnos? How can even a villain sink that low? "
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P3397657295" "You've seen the files on {BOSS_NAME}. Excessive force may be the only thing that can stop that maniac."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P792799192" "It sounds like {BOSS_NAME} of the {VillainGroup} is at it again, and the streets of Paragon City won't be safe until this has been stopped."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P3609885805" "You heard about that attack by the {VillainGroup}. If {BOSS_NAME} was the one behind it, then even the revitalized Paragon Police will have trouble bringing them to justice. Fortunately, that's why there are heroes like you."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P4084501924" "The police want to bring {BOSS_NAME} in, but they're going to have a tough time doing it. You, however, could probably handle it."
// Script Variable SEND_OFF_STRING :
"P2658214125" "It's time for justice!"
// Script Variable SEND_OFF_STRING :
"P1595042505" "It's time to avenge some crime!"
// Script Variable SEND_OFF_STRING :
"P137243067" "The battle against the force of evil begins right now!"
// Script Variable SEND_OFF_STRING :
"P1467538258" "Your enemy may be tough, but you won't back down."
// Script Variable SEND_OFF_STRING :
"P3311573999" "Strike now for justice!"
// Script Variable SEND_OFF_STRING :
"P2368743954" "You'll keep the streets of the city safe from the likes of {BOSS_NAME}."
// Script Variable SEND_OFF_STRING :
"P2990797186" "The forces of evil won't know what hit them."
// Script Variable SEND_OFF_STRING :
"P2475911431" "{BOSS_NAME} is in for an unforgettable battle."
// Script Variable SEND_OFF_STRING :
"P232241061" "Did {BOSS_NAME} think that crime would be easy in Paragon City? That's a big mistake."
// Script Variable RETURNED_STRING :
"P2925740544" "You have defeated {BOSS_NAME} and his {VillainGroup} crew. Mission Accomplished"
// Script Variable RANDOM_FAME_STRING :
"P537386439" "Hey! Look! It's {HeroName}! The one who took down {BOSS_NAME}!"
// Script Variable RANDOM_FAME_STRING :
"P744388731" "Now there's a sight! {HeroName}, standing proud, blazing a trail of justice!"
// Script Variable RANDOM_FAME_STRING :
"P1425381538" "We love you, {HeroName}!"
// Script Variable RANDOM_FAME_STRING :
"P594624362" "{HeroName}! {HeroName}! {HeroName}!"
