"P1703848909" "Way to go, {HeroName}!"
// Script Variable RANDOM_FAME_STRING :
"P1412661116" "Paragon city will always be in debt to {HeroName}."
// Script Variable RANDOM_FAME_STRING :
"P1734128226" "It really is {HeroName}! Wow!"
// Script Variable RANDOM_FAME_STRING :
"P3422729915" "Forget those post-modernist deconstructionists! {HeroName} is an example of a real hero, plain and simple."
// Script Variable RANDOM_FAME_STRING :
